  "referenceNumber": "RUS1482",
  "remarks": "\nSergei TSIVILEV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because he has been involved in in destabilizing Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, on the basis of having been, and being, supporting and promoting actions which are destabilizing Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
